  Description: Prerequisite Region - Old Cheliax Whether you come from Westcrown
    or elsewhere, you hold the values of pre-Thrune Cheliax dear. You disdain the
    infernal government, but you are proud of your country and do not consider yourself
    a rebel. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Strength or Charisma , and
    one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the Diplomacy skill and the
    Westcrown Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Group
    Impression] skill feat.
